{
    "title": "Solitaire Classic - Klondike",
    "description": "Get lost in our addictive solitaire app! Whether you're a beginner or an expert, our classic solitaire is sure to provide hours of entertainment.\r\n\r\nRemember playing Microsoft Solitaire Collection on your old Windows computer? Now you can play your favorite classic Klondike Solitaire free on your mobile device. Our game combines all the classic elements with new features like customizing the deck of cards, changing the background, and live events!\r\n\r\nThis version of the game is called Klondike or the Patience game. The rules are similar to Microsoft Solitaire Collection. All cards, initially arranged in four piles in a random sequence, must finally be arranged in ascending order, starting with the ace and finishing with the lowest card, and each pile can only include cards of a specific suit. The player will score more points the quicker they play the game.\r\n\r\nPATIENCE HIGHLIGHTS:\r\n\u2660 Classic Solitaire gameplay (same as the nostalgic Microsoft Solitaire Collection):\r\n\ud83c\udccf Klondike Solitaire uses a standard 52-card deck of playing cards without jokers. The objective of the game is to expose all cards and move them into the foundation piles. There are 4 foundation piles (one for each suit) that are represented on the screen by an \u201cA\u201d written on it. These piles are built upward in suits from Aces to Kings.\r\n\u2663\ufe0f In this Patience Classic Solitaire game, 7 tableau columns are built downward (in decreasing rank from Kings to Aces) in alternating colors (red and black). The game aims to clear all the rows into suitable foundation piles.\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Addictive and challenging levels:\r\nPractice your logic skills, memory, and patience with the all-new Daily Challenges. Play these free card games anytime on your mobile device and become a real master! Escape the chaos of the world and find some peace and solitude with our free Solitaire.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\u2660 Classic Solitaire Patience gameplay (similar to Microsoft Solitaire Collection)\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Play right-handed and left-handed\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Draw 1 card or 3 cards at a time\r\n\u2666\ufe0f New puzzles with unique ways to train your brain with card game!\r\n\u2660 Daily Challenge! Win a gift simply for showing up!\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Customizable Backgrounds and card decks.\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Multiple Hints and Undos to help you in the card game.\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Play games online or go offline with random deals.\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Events every month with special challenges and prizes!\r\n\r\nProgress tracker:\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Record all your wins\r\n\u2665\ufe0f See your improvement in real-time\r\n\r\nClassic Klondike Solitaire Card game with the same rules from Patience Microsoft Solitaire Collection:\r\n\r\n- Tap or drag to move cards, arranging them in descending order with alternating colors.\r\n- Multiple cards can be moved together, as long as the cards in the sequence being moved are in descending order and are in alternating colors (red/black, etc).\r\n- Move cards up to the foundation to sort all of the suits from Ace to King.\r\n- Only a King or a pile starting with a king can be placed in a space on the Tableau.\r\n\r\nTry Patience ad free Solitaire - a classic card game that's easy to learn and offers endless entertainment. Ad free Solitaire games are a good way to learn the basics of card games. If you used to play the classic Microsoft Solitaire Collection, you will love our game!\r\n\r\nKlondike is a great opportunity to improve your problem-solving skills! Come play the Fun Klondike card game, the best game in the World of Patience Solitaire mobility, inspired by the timeless Microsoft Solitaire Collection.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get lost in our addictive solitaire app! Whether you&#39;re a beginner or an expert, our classic solitaire is sure to provide hours of entertainment.<br><br>Remember playing Microsoft Solitaire Collection on your old Windows computer? Now you can play your favorite classic Klondike Solitaire free on your mobile device. Our game combines all the classic elements with new features like customizing the deck of cards, changing the background, and live events!<br><br>This version of the game is called Klondike or the Patience game. The rules are similar to Microsoft Solitaire Collection. All cards, initially arranged in four piles in a random sequence, must finally be arranged in ascending order, starting with the ace and finishing with the lowest card, and each pile can only include cards of a specific suit. The player will score more points the quicker they play the game.<br><br>PATIENCE HIGHLIGHTS:<br>\u2660 Classic Solitaire gameplay (same as the nostalgic Microsoft Solitaire Collection):<br>\ud83c\udccf Klondike Solitaire uses a standard 52-card deck of playing cards without jokers. The objective of the game is to expose all cards and move them into the foundation piles. There are 4 foundation piles (one for each suit) that are represented on the screen by an \u201cA\u201d written on it. These piles are built upward in suits from Aces to Kings.<br>\u2663\ufe0f In this Patience Classic Solitaire game, 7 tableau columns are built downward (in decreasing rank from Kings to Aces) in alternating colors (red and black). The game aims to clear all the rows into suitable foundation piles.<br>\u2665\ufe0f Addictive and challenging levels:<br>Practice your logic skills, memory, and patience with the all-new Daily Challenges. Play these free card games anytime on your mobile device and become a real master! Escape the chaos of the world and find some peace and solitude with our free Solitaire.<br><br>FEATURES:<br>\u2660 Classic Solitaire Patience gameplay (similar to Microsoft Solitaire Collection)<br>\u2663\ufe0f Play right-handed and left-handed<br>\u2665\ufe0f Draw 1 card or 3 cards at a time<br>\u2666\ufe0f New puzzles with unique ways to train your brain with card game!<br>\u2660 Daily Challenge! Win a gift simply for showing up!<br>\u2663\ufe0f Customizable Backgrounds and card decks.<br>\u2665\ufe0f Multiple Hints and Undos to help you in the card game.<br>\u2666\ufe0f Play games online or go offline with random deals.<br>\u2666\ufe0f Events every month with special challenges and prizes!<br><br>Progress tracker:<br>\u2665\ufe0f Record all your wins<br>\u2665\ufe0f See your improvement in real-time<br><br>Classic Klondike Solitaire Card game with the same rules from Patience Microsoft Solitaire Collection:<br><br>- Tap or drag to move cards, arranging them in descending order with alternating colors.<br>- Multiple cards can be moved together, as long as the cards in the sequence being moved are in descending order and are in alternating colors (red/black, etc).<br>- Move cards up to the foundation to sort all of the suits from Ace to King.<br>- Only a King or a pile starting with a king can be placed in a space on the Tableau.<br><br>Try Patience ad free Solitaire - a classic card game that&#39;s easy to learn and offers endless entertainment. Ad free Solitaire games are a good way to learn the basics of card games. If you used to play the classic Microsoft Solitaire Collection, you will love our game!<br><br>Klondike is a great opportunity to improve your problem-solving skills! Come play the Fun Klondike card game, the best game in the World of Patience Solitaire mobility, inspired by the timeless Microsoft Solitaire Collection.",
